{"id":100120,"slug":"100120-lam-autocomplete-goi-y-khi-go-nen-dung-cach-nao","category":"Elasticsearch","subcategory":"Search","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Làm autocomplete (gợi ý khi gõ) nên dùng cách nào?","question_en":"How should autocomplete (type-ahead) be implemented?","answer_vi":"Ba lựa chọn, chọn theo yêu cầu:\n\n1. **`completion` suggester** — nhanh nhất, dựng FST trong memory, phù hợp khi chỉ cần gợi ý tiền tố từ một danh sách.\n\n```json\n\"suggest\": { \"s\": { \"prefix\": \"lap\", \"completion\": { \"field\": \"suggest\", \"fuzzy\": { \"fuzziness\": 1 } } } }\n```\n\n2. **`search_as_you_type`** — field type dựng sẵn n-gram, khớp cả cụm ở giữa, dễ dùng hơn completion và vẫn nhanh.\n\n3. **Edge n-gram analyzer tự cấu hình** — linh hoạt nhất, kết hợp được với filter và boost nghiệp vụ.\n\n```json\n\"analyzer\": { \"autocomplete\": {\n  \"tokenizer\": \"standard\",\n  \"filter\": [\"lowercase\", { \"type\": \"edge_ngram\", \"min_gram\": 2, \"max_gram\": 15 }]\n}}\n```\n\nĐiểm bắt buộc với edge n-gram: **`search_analyzer` phải KHÁC `analyzer`**. Không tách ra thì chuỗi user gõ cũng bị n-gram và kết quả loạn hẳn.\n\nĐánh đổi: `completion` tốn heap và không filter được linh hoạt; n-gram làm index phình đáng kể. Với e-commerce cần lọc theo category và còn hàng, n-gram thường là lựa chọn thực tế.","answer_en":"Three options, chosen by requirements:\n\n1. **The `completion` suggester** — fastest, builds an in-memory FST, right when you only need prefix suggestions from a list.\n\n```json\n\"suggest\": { \"s\": { \"prefix\": \"lap\", \"completion\": { \"field\": \"suggest\", \"fuzzy\": { \"fuzziness\": 1 } } } }\n```\n\n2. **`search_as_you_type`** — a built-in field type generating n-grams, matching mid-phrase, easier than completion and still fast.\n\n3. **A hand-configured edge n-gram analyzer** — the most flexible, combining with filters and business boosts.\n\n```json\n\"analyzer\": { \"autocomplete\": {\n  \"tokenizer\": \"standard\",\n  \"filter\": [\"lowercase\", { \"type\": \"edge_ngram\", \"min_gram\": 2, \"max_gram\": 15 }]\n}}\n```\n\nMandatory with edge n-grams: **`search_analyzer` must DIFFER from `analyzer`**. Otherwise the user query is n-grammed too and results become nonsense.\n\nTrade-offs: `completion` costs heap and filters poorly; n-grams inflate the index noticeably. For e-commerce needing category and stock filters, n-grams are usually the practical choice","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Ba lựa chọn, chọn theo yêu cầu:</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">1. <strong><code>completion</code> suggester</strong> — nhanh nhất, dựng FST trong memory, phù hợp khi chỉ cần gợi ý tiền tố từ một danh sách.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">json</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&quot;suggest&quot;: { &quot;s&quot;: { &quot;prefix&quot;: &quot;lap&quot;, &quot;completion&quot;: { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;suggest&quot;, &quot;fuzzy&quot;: { &quot;fuzziness&quot;: 1 } } } }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;suggest&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;s&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;prefix&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;lap&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;completion&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;field&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;suggest&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;fuzzy&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;fuzziness&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">2. <strong><code>search_as_you_type</code></strong> — field type dựng sẵn n-gram, khớp cả cụm ở giữa, dễ dùng hơn completion và vẫn nhanh.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">3. <strong>Edge n-gram analyzer tự cấu hình</strong> — linh hoạt nhất, kết hợp được với filter và boost nghiệp vụ.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">json</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&quot;analyzer&quot;: { &quot;autocomplete&quot;: {\n  &quot;tokenizer&quot;: &quot;standard&quot;,\n  &quot;filter&quot;: [&quot;lowercase&quot;, { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;edge_ngram&quot;, &quot;min_gram&quot;: 2, &quot;max_gram&quot;: 15 }]\n}}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;analyzer&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;autocomplete&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;tokenizer&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;standard&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;filter&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;lowercase&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;edge_ngram&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;min_gram&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;max_gram&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">15</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Điểm bắt buộc với edge n-gram: <strong><code>search_analyzer</code> phải KHÁC <code>analyzer</code></strong>. Không tách ra thì chuỗi user gõ cũng bị n-gram và kết quả loạn hẳn.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Đánh đổi: <code>completion</code> tốn heap và không filter được linh hoạt; n-gram làm index phình đáng kể. Với e-commerce cần lọc theo category và còn hàng, n-gram thường là lựa chọn thực tế.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Three options, chosen by requirements:</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">1. <strong>The <code>completion</code> suggester</strong> — fastest, builds an in-memory FST, right when you only need prefix suggestions from a list.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">json</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&quot;suggest&quot;: { &quot;s&quot;: { &quot;prefix&quot;: &quot;lap&quot;, &quot;completion&quot;: { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;suggest&quot;, &quot;fuzzy&quot;: { &quot;fuzziness&quot;: 1 } } } }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;suggest&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;s&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;prefix&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;lap&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;completion&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;field&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;suggest&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;fuzzy&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;fuzziness&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">2. <strong><code>search_as_you_type</code></strong> — a built-in field type generating n-grams, matching mid-phrase, easier than completion and still fast.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">3. <strong>A hand-configured edge n-gram analyzer</strong> — the most flexible, combining with filters and business boosts.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">json</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&quot;analyzer&quot;: { &quot;autocomplete&quot;: {\n  &quot;tokenizer&quot;: &quot;standard&quot;,\n  &quot;filter&quot;: [&quot;lowercase&quot;, { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;edge_ngram&quot;, &quot;min_gram&quot;: 2, &quot;max_gram&quot;: 15 }]\n}}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;analyzer&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;autocomplete&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;tokenizer&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;standard&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;filter&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;lowercase&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;edge_ngram&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;min_gram&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;max_gram&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">15</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Mandatory with edge n-grams: <strong><code>search_analyzer</code> must DIFFER from <code>analyzer</code></strong>. Otherwise the user query is n-grammed too and results become nonsense.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Trade-offs: <code>completion</code> costs heap and filters poorly; n-grams inflate the index noticeably. For e-commerce needing category and stock filters, n-grams are usually the practical choice.</p>","references":[{"label":"Elastic — Suggesters","url":"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/search-suggesters.html"},{"label":"Elastic — Anatomy of an analyzer","url":"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/analyzer-anatomy.html"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/100111-vi-sao-from-size-bi-gioi-han-o-10-000-va-thay-bang-gi","title":"Vì sao `from`/`size` bị giới hạn ở 10.000 và thay bằng gì?"},{"url":"/q/100121-highlight-tu-khoa-trong-ket-qua-nen-lam-o-server-hay-client","title":"Highlight từ khoá trong kết quả nên làm ở server hay client?"},{"url":"/q/100101-inverted-index-la-gi-va-vi-sao-no-lam-full-text-search-nhanh","title":"Inverted index là gì và vì sao nó làm full-text search nhanh?"},{"url":"/q/100102-shard-va-replica-khac-nhau-the-nao-chon-so-shard-bao-nhieu","title":"Shard và replica khác nhau thế nào? Chọn số shard bao nhiêu?"},{"url":"/q/100103-text-va-keyword-khac-nhau-ra-sao-khi-nao-dung-cai-nao","title":"`text` và `keyword` khác nhau ra sao? Khi nào dùng cái nào?"},{"url":"/q/100104-analyzer-gom-nhung-thanh-phan-nao-va-vi-sao-phai-hieu-no","title":"Analyzer gồm những thành phần nào và vì sao phải hiểu nó?"},{"url":"/q/100105-match-va-term-khac-nhau-the-nao-vi-sao-term-hay-tra-ve-rong","title":"`match` và `term` khác nhau thế nào? Vì sao `term` hay trả về rỗng?"},{"url":"/q/100106-index-xong-mot-document-nhung-search-ngay-khong-thay-vi-sao","title":"Index xong một document nhưng search ngay không thấy. Vì sao?"}]}